Package: luci-app-singbox-admin
Version: 0.0.1
Depends: luci-base, sing-box, nftables
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Yukiinagato
Description: LuCI web admin for sing-box on OpenWrt
 Modern JS LuCI app (no luci-compat/lua runtime needed): a live dashboard
 (service state, per-process CPU/RAM, clash-api connection count, listening
 sockets and logs), a config.json editor with sing-box validation and
 timestamped backups/restore, a rollback-protected nftables/tproxy
 firewall-script manager (validate, apply now, apply on boot), and one-click
 sing-box binary updates from GitHub releases -- opkg or apk, with
 architecture auto-detection.
